From 2b24d8b7ed2d526d13bbafa502804a72a68eebf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (dev box)" <claude@loukdekker.nl>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:07:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(web): override a title's art from the cache browser

The override API needs a way in from the admin UI. Each row of the
Posters, Logos, Backdrops and Episodes lists gets an "Override" button
that opens a compact picker: it resolves the row's id to its title, shows
every TMDB and fanart.tv candidate with the automatic pick and the current
override marked, and can save a candidate, upload an image, switch the
rating badges off, or clear the override. The list refreshes afterwards,
since the save purged the title's cached renders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
